stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> anonymous
  anonymous --> authenticating: loginStarted
  authenticating --> authenticated: loginSucceeded(generation, token)
  authenticating --> anonymous: loginFailed
  authenticated --> refreshing: sessionExpired / request401(current generation)
  refreshing --> refreshing: request401(same generation)\njoin shared refresh
  refreshing --> authenticated: refreshSucceeded(next generation, token)\nretry each waiting request once
  refreshing --> anonymous: refreshFailed
  authenticated --> anonymous: logout
  refreshing --> anonymous: logout
  authenticating --> anonymous: logout

  note right of refreshing
    SessionRefreshCoordinator increments refreshCalls once.
    A stale generation is ignored; a request already retried
    cannot join a later refresh or start another refresh loop.
    SessionService shares one HTTP refresh promise per session generation.
    Logout invalidates the session epoch before secure storage is cleared;
    late refresh responses cannot persist or restore the session.
  end note

  note left of authenticated
    Secure storage contains actorId only because the teaching backend
    requires it for X-Course-Actor after app restart, plus accessToken,
    refreshToken and expiresAt. Role is validated at login, not persisted.
    Logout is local; the backend has no logout endpoint.
  end note
